 "provenance_note": "basis_audit and census_audit pin the raw sha256 of basis_170.json, which carries a wall-clock field, so they inherit its variation.  Every substantive field matches.  The design fault is that a provenance hash should cover canonical content rather than raw bytes; fixing it would rewrite the frozen basis artifacts, so it is reported, not changed",
